        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Fall Out Boy\n- Products: Infinity on High, From Under the Cork Tree, Folie à Deux, The Take Over, the Breaks Over, America's Suitehearts\n- Companies: Island Records\n- Topics: album leaks, single releases\n\nFacts:\n- Fall Out Boy's third album, Infinity on High, leaked onto the internet on January 19, 2007, three weeks before its scheduled release.\n- Fall Out Boy released Infinity on High, its third studio album, on February 6, 2007 through Island Records.\n- Infinity on High followed Fall Out Boy's commercially successful 2005 album From Under the Cork Tree.\n- The Take Over, the Breaks Over is a song by Fall Out Boy and the fourth single from the band's 2007 third studio album Infinity on High.\n- America's Suitehearts is a song by Fall Out Boy and the second single from the band's 2008 fourth studio album Folie à Deux.",
